  lines:
  - speakerName: Akila
    dialogueText: Home. It still looks the same... but it doesn't feel like home anymore.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Akila
    dialogueText: I should find Mom first. I can't just wander off like nothing's wrong.
